    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Watch the development of this game live on twitch!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i></i>Inhabitants is a single-player horror game that has you delve into the mysterious disappearance of your friend.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > They left without a trace. Their apartment was left unlocked and seemingly empty. Maybe there is something that can point you in the right direction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/5ae4c49e2027aa834378bc58e898e8e1.poster.avif?t=1735070199\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/5ae4c49e2027aa834378bc58e898e8e1.webm?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/5ae4c49e2027aa834378bc58e898e8e1.mp4?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the mysteries behind their disappearance.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only clue is their computer. But what lies within may not be best if found.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/904106cd1c3deee7ae8cdd6e9fd14611.poster.avif?t=1735070199\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/904106cd1c3deee7ae8cdd6e9fd14611.webm?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/904106cd1c3deee7ae8cdd6e9fd14611.mp4?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The apartment isn't empty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They know you don't belong.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/f45e0a6942a445427e4b2a9224fc9e7e.poster.avif?t=1735070199\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/f45e0a6942a445427e4b2a9224fc9e7e.webm?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874740/extras/f45e0a6942a445427e4b2a9224fc9e7e.mp4?t=1735070199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay on your toes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no safe spaces.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzle Room Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabitants (the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabitants (inside the walls)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Real-Time Horror </p></li></ul>",
